messages[14]{user,text}:
  user_1,Hi Suresh I'm calling about my auto insurance policy
  user_2,Ah Reyansh good afternoon I've got you on my screen right now Can you hear me okay
  user_1,Yeah I can hear you fine Thanks for taking my call
  user_2,No problem at all Reyansh I see that your policy is up for renewal but it's been cancelled due to two missed payments
  user_1,[sighs] Yeah I know I've been meaning to call about that I've been having some issues with my bank
  user_2,I understand that unforeseen circumstances can happen Let me see what I can do to help you [typing]
  user_1,So what are my options
  user_2,Well Reyansh I can offer you a payment plan to reinstate your policy But if you decide not to reinstate it will remain cancelled
  user_1,[pauses] That sounds good I think I'd like to reinstate it
  user_2,Great I just need to put you on hold for a minute while I check a few things [hold music starts]
  user_2,[hold music ends] Okay Reyansh I've checked and everything looks good To reinstate your policy I'll need you to make a payment of $500 by the end of the week
  user_1,That sounds doable But what if I miss another payment
  user_2,If you miss another payment Reyansh your policy will be cancelled again and you'll have to reapply [dog barks in the background]
  user_1,Okay got it I'll make sure to make the payment on time
  user_2,Great I'll send you a confirmation email with all the details [typing]